[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    105[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the precompiled standard library, whose UB checks are off, so they fault exactly
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    106[0m:[38;5;10m[49m like the C in every profile. Confirmed by isolating the four load/store forms:
